    "text": "<p>Match List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> with List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td>Sodium Carbonate</td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td>Deacon</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td>Titanium</td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Castner-Kellner</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td>Chlorine</td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td>van-Arkel</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td>Sodium hydroxide</td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td>Solvay</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
