    "text": "<p>(a) Sodium carbonate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> &amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NaHCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;prepared by Solvay process.</p><p>(b) Titanium is refined by Van-Arkel process.</p><p>Titanium :&nbsp;Van arkel method</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></munder></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></munder><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></munderover><munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mrow><mi>Refined</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>titanium</mi></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></munder></math></p><p>(c) Chlorine is prepared by Deacon process.</p><p>Chlorine : Decon&#39;s process</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><mi>CuCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>(d) Sodium hydroxide is prepared by Castner -&nbsp;Kellner process.</p>",
